  "chapter": "longest_window_at_most_k_bad",
  "tier": 3,
  "mode": "build",
  "concepts": ["sliding_window", "two_pointers"],
  "prerequisites": ["arrays"],
  "story": "A radio log marks each second 1 when the signal was clear and 0 when it dropped out. An engineer can patch at most k dropouts. After patching, what is the longest run of clear seconds she can get? Long logs must be checked within the step budget.",
