  "performance": {"required": true, "baselineFactor": 10},
  "hints": ["Starting a new count at every second works, but on a log that is mostly clear each count runs almost to the end.", "Keep a window with a left and a right edge and count the dropouts inside it.", "Grow the window to the right one second at a time. When it holds more than k dropouts, move the left edge right until it holds k again. The best window is the answer."],
